_12cd_892710.fa%2BYourSeq%26c%3Dchr6%26l%3D55659827%26r%3D55659847%26db%3Dhg19%26hgsid%3D459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234571908000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21yhWDSHLqkkMH38UGlYOj\">details</a> YourSeq           20    58    77    92 100.0%     6   -   55659828  55659847     20\r\n</pre></tt><br>I then search using NCBI BLAST. It properly identified it as coming from an ERCC spike-in (84 of the 92 bases match).<br><br><table><tbody><tr><th>Score</th><th>Expect</th><th>Identities</th><th>Gaps</th><th>Strand</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>156 bits(84)</td>\r\n<td>6e-35</td>\r\n<td>84/84(100%)</td>\r\n<td>0/84(0%)</td>\r\n<td>Plus/Plus</td>\r\n\r\n</tr></tbody></table>\r\n\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n<pre>Query  9   AGATAAAACGAATAGCTCGTAACCAAACATGCACAGCGGTCAAACAGTATGTCCCAAGGG  68\r\n           ||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||||\r\nSbjct  1   AGATAAAACGAATAGCTCGTAACCAAACATGCACAGCGGTCAAACAGTATGTCCCAAGGG  60\r\n\r\nQuery  69  GACTTAAGCGCGGTGGCCTCCCCT  92\r\n           ||||||||||||||||||||||||\r\nSbjct  61  GACTTAAGCGCGGTGGCCTCCCCT  84\r\n\r\nI have the ERCC sequences included in my indexed genome, so could have been potentially mapped to the correct location. But I&#39;d prefer that it be called as unmapped in v1.4.4 than mapped to the wrong location in v1.5.0. Could you provide insight into why this read was assigned to chromosome 20?<br><br># Example 3 - Off by 1<br><br>I noticed many cases where the mapping was off by 1 base. An example from the diff file:<br><br>&lt; HWI-700819F:305:C723YACXX:2:2101:13993:55263:UMI_AGCGAGGG     0       chr10   79793507<br>&gt; HWI-700819F:305:C723YACXX:2:2101:13993:55263:UMI_AGCGAGGG     0       chr10   79793508<br><br>Obtaining the sequence:<br><br>zcat test-pass.fastq.gz | grep HWI-700819F:305:C723YACXX:2:2101:13993:55263:UMI_AGCGAGGG -A 3<br>@HWI-700819F:305:C723YACXX:2:2101:13993:55263:UMI_AGCGAGGG 1:N:0:GTCAATCC<br>GAGCCTAAATCAGGCATCGGCGCGGTCAGCCTCGTGGCGCGCCCACGCCCCCACGCCGGCTCTTCCCGGGG<br>+<br>FFFFFIIIIIFIFIIIFFFFFFIFIBFFFFFFF&lt;&lt;BB&lt;7&lt;7BBFFBBBBF&lt;B7&lt;77B&lt;&lt;B7&lt;00&lt;BB7777<br><br>Based on BLAT, the new result with v1.5.0 is correct.<br>\r\n<tt><pre>   ACTIONS      QUERY           SCORE START  END QSIZE IDENTITY CHRO STRAND  START    END      SPAN\r\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n<a href=\"https://www.genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgTracks?position=chr10:79793508-79793577&amp;db=hg19&amp;ss=../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.pslx+../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.fa&amp;hgsid=459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgTracks?position%3Dchr10:79793508-79793577%26db%3Dhg19%26ss%3D../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.pslx%2B../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.fa%26hgsid%3D459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234571908000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IIQKv98_uA3asiPgiwcxr\">browser</a> <a href=\"https://www.genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgc?o=79793507&amp;g=htcUserAli&amp;i=../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.pslx+..%2Ftrash%2FhgSs%2FhgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.fa+YourSeq&amp;c=chr10&amp;l=79793507&amp;r=79793577&amp;db=hg19&amp;hgsid=459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgc?o%3D79793507%26g%3DhtcUserAli%26i%3D../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.pslx%2B..%252Ftrash%252FhgSs%252FhgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.fa%2BYourSeq%26c%3Dchr10%26l%3D79793507%26r%3D79793577%26db%3Dhg19%26hgsid%3D459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234571908000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3I4et9t2ITGSxbx8t96BnZ\">details</a> YourSeq           70     2    71    71 100.0%    10   +   79793508  79793577     70\r\n<a href=\"https://www.genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgTracks?position=chr3:112843445-112843464&amp;db=hg19&amp;ss=../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.pslx+../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.fa&amp;hgsid=459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgTracks?position%3Dchr3:112843445-112843464%26db%3Dhg19%26ss%3D../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.pslx%2B../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.fa%26hgsid%3D459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234571908000&amp;usg=AOvVaw01t_9kgIgEC22o5VcdGf3W\">browser</a> <a href=\"https://www.genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgc?o=112843444&amp;g=htcUserAli&amp;i=../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.pslx+..%2Ftrash%2FhgSs%2FhgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.fa+YourSeq&amp;c=chr3&amp;l=112843444&amp;r=112843464&amp;db=hg19&amp;hgsid=459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.genome.ucsc.edu/cgi-bin/hgc?o%3D112843444%26g%3DhtcUserAli%26i%3D../trash/hgSs/hgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.pslx%2B..%252Ftrash%252FhgSs%252FhgSs_www_5e6b_899a60.fa%2BYourSeq%26c%3Dchr3%26l%3D112843444%26r%3D112843464%26db%3Dhg19%26hgsid%3D459042691_KYaAi2Aus3nZA1YLXEhvkcvRJymO&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234571908000&amp;usg=AOvVaw321g0F7Tuh7R8gL1B8b_Jn\">details</a> YourSeq           20    38    57    71 100.0%     3   -  112843445 112843464     20\r\n</pre></tt><br></pre></div>Thanks,<br><br>John<br><br></div>"
